db_id":2207,"content_type":"movie","title":"16 Blocks","title_en":null,"title_fr":"16 blocs","original_title":null,"tagline":null,"description":"يتم توكيل شرطي في مهمة ليرافق مجرم قليل الشأن ليدلي بشهادته، لكن سرعان ما تصبح المهمة الروتينية معركة من أجل البقاء ستغير الرجلين إلى الأبد.","description_en":"An aging cop is assigned the ordinary task of escorting a fast-talking witness from police custody to a courthouse, but they find themselves running the gauntlet as other forces try to prevent them from getting there.","description_fr":"Tout ce qu’il voulait, c’était rentrer chez lui. Pourtant, juste à la fin de son service, l’inspecteur Jack Mosley se voit confier une petite mission. Il doit escorter Eddie Bunker jusqu’au palais de justice où, deux heures plus tard, celui-ci témoignera dans une importante affaire de meurtre. La corvée ne devait prendre que dix minutes, le temps de remonter les seize pâtés de maison. Mais tout va déraper car certains sont prêts à tout pour que le témoin gênant n’arrive jamais au tribunal.","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cBLqMVfTZpuKmMQKDLKusb93dbR.jpg","backdrop":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/z7BhlDkhAprUHugZlkVB9TPcB0T.jpg","has_poster":true,"rating":6.5,"vote_count":2217,"age_rating":"PG-13","year":"2006","release_date":"2006-03-01","runtime_minutes":105,"status":"Released","country":"الولايات المتحدة","language":"الإنجليزية","genres":["حركة","مغامرة","جريمة","إثارة","أكشن","دراما"],"genre_keys":["action","adventure","crime","thriller","drama"],"similar":["mv637649","mv324552","mv254128","mv1949","mv376290","mv338766","mv268","mv97367"],"director":"Richard Donner","cast":[{"name":"Bruce Willis","character":"Jack Mosley","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/w3aXr1e7gQCn8MSp1vW4sXHn99P.jpg"},{"name":"Yasiin Bey","character":"Eddie Bunker","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/cu6pZ0ThtrT9Mo3l2cKk3UjYhmE.jpg"},{"name":"David Morse","character":"Frank Nugent","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/