n he unleashes precision skills during a heist. The crew is left wondering who he is and where he came from. Soon, the marksman's ultimate motive becomes clear as he takes dramatic and irrevocable steps to settle a score.","description_fr":"Un convoyeur de fond, fraîchement engagé, surprend ses collègues par l’incroyable précision de ses tirs de riposte, alors qu’ils subissent les assauts de braqueurs expérimentés. Tous se demandent désormais qui il est, d’où il vient et pourquoi il est là.","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l8XzwPD0QCH5J8TGReIxZpL4ZZa.jpg","backdrop":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/70AV2Xx5FQYj20labp0EGdbjI6E.jpg","has_poster":true,"rating":7.6,"vote_count":6427,"age_rating":"R","year":"2021","release_date":"2021-04-22","runtime_minutes":119,"status":"Released","country":"الولايات المتحدة","language":"الإنجليزية","genres":["إثارة","جريمة","دراما","أكشن"],"genre_keys":["thriller","crime","drama","action"],"similar":["mv2207","mv1949","mv376290","mv324552","mv338766","mv97367","mv449443","mv1047020"],"director":"غاي ريتشي","cast":[{"name":"جيسون ستاثام","character":"H","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/8l6lmrmKFDvhDjMJPj6tBpJdhaA.jpg"},{"name":"هولت مكالاني","character":"Bullet","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/b1FEXFQ8ZnvXhVrMqCv5mTJ8aW3.jpg"},{"name":"Rocci Williams","character":"Hollow Bob","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/e5GWh54fUmbupb5DKsSNU5axEx2.jpg"},{"name":"جوش هارتنت","character":"Boy Sweat Dave","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/5eMo8D7h1XrSu6ZN4UXhPcS6YNG.jpg"},{"name":"Jeffrey Donovan","character":"Jackson","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/wlDXfXpu6Uz32LUmbFzU8QPDoQH.jpg"},{"name":"Scott Eastwood","character":"Jan","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/tKJEy1bFNxvIj7sivsB7Us2ThmY.jpg"},{"name":"أندي غارسيا","character":"Agent King","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/9EivXoBlczZcFBet96WOoFbDsfF.jpg"},{"name":"Deobia Oparei","c