 conduit dans un piège : il veut que les magiciens braquent l’un des systèmes informatiques les plus sécurisés du monde. Pour sortir de ce chantage et déjouer les plans de ce syndicat du crime, ils vont devoir élaborer le braquage le plus spectaculaire jamais conçu.","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A81kDB6a1K86YLlcOtZB27jriJh.jpg","backdrop":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/oFQilRMEq6yQbtMPxIYWpXeQ5ZN.jpg","has_poster":true,"rating":6.8,"vote_count":11965,"age_rating":"PG-13","year":"2016","release_date":"2016-06-02","runtime_minutes":129,"status":"Released","country":"الولايات المتحدة","language":"الإنجليزية","genres":["جريمة","إثارة","غموض"],"genre_keys":["crime","thriller","mystery"],"similar":["mv1949","mv71305","mv637649","mv376290","mv324552","mv338766","mv30497","mv97367"],"director":"جون إم. تشو","cast":[{"name":"جيسي آيزينبيرغ","character":"J. Daniel Atlas","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/2ojZrkt5rdkUi857WSeCatxXdGS.jpg"},{"name":"مارك رافالو","character":"Dylan Rhodes","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/5GilHMOt5PAQh6rlUKZzGmaKEI7.jpg"},{"name":"وودي هارلسون","character":"Merritt McKinney / Chase McKinney","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/igxYDQBbTEdAqaJxaW6ffqswmUU.jpg"},{"name":"ديف فرانكو","character":"Jack Wilder","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/nMROwyhekhgV5jU9TLQQAsjpNdw.jpg"},{"name":"دانيال رادكليف","character":"Walter Mabry","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/uUFfo8RANo7tuckB6AZAnESne55.jpg"},{"name":"Lizzy Caplan","character":"Lula","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/cHs9pPpjcEMpWrGmrAYAn0QOE78.jpg"},{"name":"مورغان فريمان","character":"Thaddeus Bradley","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/jPsLqiYGSofU4s6BjrxnefMfabb.jpg"},{"name":"دجاي شو","character":"Li","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/7kQYk466uzk58BrzPBHFyniRt7Q.jpg"},{"name":"سانا لاثان","character":"Deputy Director Natalie Austin","profile_image":"https://image