_en":"A former Marine races against time to save a group of hostages -- including his young daughter and a congressman — when armed militants take over his stepfather's store.","description_fr":"Père célibataire et ancien marine, Kyle Snowden, souffre de stress post-traumatique. Il a bien du mal à se réadapter à la vie. Bientôt, Kyle se retrouve, avec un groupe de clients innocents, piégé dans le magasin de son beau-père lors d'une prise d'otage par un militant, Eagan Raize. Des détails troublants émergent sur la violente vendetta d'Eagan contre le beau-père de Kyle, le député Sam Nelson, menaçant la vie de toutes les personnes présentes, y compris le député et la jeune fille de Kyle.","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zedUsN2fxRYhrp8k4uHVZuoEPaj.jpg","backdrop":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ZCqWozXgbE1SXe4St07kCT3gey.jpg","has_poster":true,"rating":5.6,"vote_count":216,"age_rating":"NR","year":"2021","release_date":"2021-06-11","runtime_minutes":94,"status":"Released","country":"الولايات المتحدة","language":"الإنجليزية","genres":["حركة","مغامرة","إثارة","فيلم تلفازي","أكشن"],"genre_keys":["action","adventure","thriller"],"similar":["mv324552","mv912649","mv2207","mv254128","mv823625","mv634649","mv637649","mv429617"],"director":"Jon Keeyes","cast":[{"name":"Tyrese Gibson","character":"Kyle Snowden","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/jxoy4fbXNKFQtBdK73cLXEz3ufS.jpg"},{"name":"جون مالكوفيتش","character":"Sam Nelson","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/7GoOdGNc4ra1L0F5nJTkmIB37iu.jpg"},{"name":"Michael Jai White","character":"Sparks","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/YPoHYuzR37wFpPpwEXZYQlhLln.jpg"},{"name":"Holly Taylor","character":"Mikki","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/4L31T8MryaStQ1UAp1EuBTOKqLk.jpg"},{"name":"لورن فيليز","character":"Sunshine","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/98BvmTJCZHx0jPv0oNcv04Jkmfb.jpg"},{"name":"Christopher Backus","character":"Eagan","profile_image":"htt